#  | 3.3 | 2.5 | 1.8 | 1.2 | 143 | 141 | 137 | 135 | 132 | 128 | 126 | 124 | 120 | 115 | 112 | 110 | 5V  | 5V  | 3V3 | 3V3 | 2V5 | 2V5 | GND |
#  +-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+
#                                                                                                                                               BUTTON 114
#                                                                                                                                +-----+-----+
#                                                                                                                                | 105 | 106 |
