#                               LED 3                                                                                            +-----+-----+
#                               LED 7                                                                                            |  98 |  99 |  BUTTON 89
#                               LED 11                                                                                           +-----+-----+
#                                                                                                                                |  85 |  86 |
#                                                                                                                                +-----+-----+
#                                                                                                                                |  77 |  83 | 
#                                                                                                                                +-----+-----+  BUTTON 88
#                                                                                                                                |  76 |  28 | 
#                                                                                                                                +-----+-----+
#                                                                                                                                |  30 |  31 | 
#                                                                                                                                +-----+-----+
#                                                                                                                                |  32 |  33 |  BUTTON 80
#                                                                                                                                +-----+-----+
