#  | VB  | VB  | VB  | VB  | 39  | 43  | 46  | 50  | 52  | 54  | 58  | 60  | 65  | 67  | 69  | 71  | NC  | 1V8 | 1V8 | 1V2 | 1V2 | GND | GND |
